WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.820
this is the fan people buy when they can't sleep without a fan

00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:05.420
if you get hot at night or hate sleeping in a stuffy room

00:00:05.421 --> 00:00:07.660
just pop one of these bad boys next to your bed

00:00:07.661 --> 00:00:10.900
it starts at level 1 and goes all the way up to 199

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.540
and oh my gosh it blows so cold

00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:15.440
but that's not all because just by holding down the power button

00:00:15.441 --> 00:00:17.540
you'll see what happens to the metal piece in the middle

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:18.660
yes it's condensing

00:00:18.661 --> 00:00:20.620
which means it delivers even cooler air

00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:22.420
heat at night is so over stimulating

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.460
so this is a total game changer for sleep

00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:26.220
you can also place it on your nightstand

00:00:26.221 --> 00:00:28.780
I was honestly surprised by how affordable it is too

00:00:28.781 --> 00:00:30.840
I have it linked here if you wanna check it out
